{"kind":"article","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/psreader\/edition-platforms"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/psreader\/edition-platforms"]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Identifiers","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/The-Edition-Model"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Editions-and-Content","title":"Editions and Content"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PageSuite serves editions from two systems:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"current edition system"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" serves every kind of edition: classic","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"PDF editions laid out like the printed paper, responsive HTML editions,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and editions that mix the two. Both the prebuilt UI and a custom UI","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"show every edition on it. These docs call them editions, and say “on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the current system” where the system matters.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"legacy replica system"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" is the previous generation. It serves","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"classic PDF editions only, and only the prebuilt UI shows them. These","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"docs call them legacy replica editions. If you call your editions","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“print replicas”, that describes the classic PDF look, which either","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"system can serve; see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Edition-Platforms#Telling-Which-System-a-Publication-Is-On"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Current system"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Legacy replica system"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Edition looks"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Classic PDF, responsive HTML, mixed"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Classic PDF"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Prebuilt UI"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Custom UI"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Identifier"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Publication GUID"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Replica publication GUID"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“Classic PDF” and “responsive” describe how an edition looks. “Current”"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and “legacy replica” describe which system serves it. A classic PDF"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edition can be on either system, and on the current system it works with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a custom UI like any other edition. Many API names call the current"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system “feed”, its old name; see "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Edition-Platforms#Historic-API-Names","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"columns":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"reader-classic-pdf","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"size":1},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"reader-responsive"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"size":1}],"numberOfColumns":2,"type":"row"},{"anchor":"Telling-Which-System-a-Publication-Is-On","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Telling Which System a Publication Is On"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A publication GUID and a replica publication GUID look alike, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value won’t tell you. The label does: PageSuite supplies a “publication"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GUID” for a title on the current system and a “replica publication GUID”"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for one on the legacy system. If you’re not sure which you were given,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ask your PageSuite account manager. A title that moved from the legacy"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system to the current one has both, and they’re different values. See"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Identifiers","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You don’t always need to know:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A dynamic archive, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".dynamicArchive(_:shortcode:config:)"},{"type":"text","text":", reads each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"publication’s system from its shortcode’s configuration and shows it the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"right way."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With a GUID in hand, ask "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedEditionService","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for its archive. If"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editions come back, the publication is on the current system, and both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sides can show it:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let service = FeedEditionService(accountGUID: \"ACCOUNT_GUID\")","let archive = try await service.publishedEditions(publicationGUID: \"PUBLICATION_GUID\")"],"lineAnnotations":[],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"showLineNumbers":false},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A replica publication GUID has no archive on the current system, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the call throws an error. An error or an empty archive doesn’t prove a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"title is legacy, though: a publication on the current system that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hasn’t published anything yet has no editions either, and a mistyped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GUID or the wrong account GUID throws the same error. Check with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PageSuite before you treat a title as legacy."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"At runtime, analytics events tell the systems apart: editions on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"current system report "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"feedEdition…"},{"type":"text","text":" events, and replica editions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"report "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"replica…"},{"type":"text","text":" events. See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Analytics","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The core SDK has no replica path. To build a custom UI for a title that’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still on the legacy system, ask PageSuite about moving it to the current"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"What Differs in the Prebuilt UI","anchor":"What-Differs-in-the-Prebuilt-UI","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The prebuilt UI shows replica editions alongside editions on the current"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system. Where they behave differently, the prebuilt guides say so in a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"callout marked “Replica”. The differences, in short:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Archives and kiosks."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":".replicaArchive(guid:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" lists a replica"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"publication’s editions, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".replicaPublicationKiosk(publications:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gathers several, each a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/KioskReplicaPublication","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". See"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Embedding-Prebuilt-Screens","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Opening an edition directly."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedReaderViewController","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" opens"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editions on the current system only. Replica editions open from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carousel and the prebuilt screens. See"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Presenting-the-Prebuilt-Reader","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The reader."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" Replica editions open in the legacy replica reader,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"configured through "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/LegacyReaderConfiguration","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", or in the reader that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editions on the current system use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ReaderConfiguration\/useLegacyReplicaReader","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" chooses; it defaults to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the legacy reader for now and will default to the modern reader in a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"future release. See "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Customizing-the-Reader-Screen","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Delegates."}]},{"type":"text","text":" The paywall, share, and audio delegates have methods for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replica editions:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PaywallDelegate\/paywallViewControllerForAction(openReplicaEdition:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ShareDelegate\/shareContext(forSpread:inReplicaEdition:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/AudioDelegate\/playAudio(forSpread:inReplicaEdition:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", among others."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Paywalls","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Sharing","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Text-to-Speech","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Analytics."}]},{"type":"text","text":" Replica editions report "},{"code":"replica…","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" events in place of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"code":"feedEdition…","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" ones, with their own contexts. See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Analytics","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Search."}]},{"type":"text","text":" Replica publications are searched through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ReplicaSearchService","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", which finds pages only, in one publication per"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request. See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Search","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Historic API Names","anchor":"Historic-API-Names","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some API names use older words for the systems and for the classic PDF"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"look. They’re part of the shipped API and stay as they are."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“Feed” means the current system."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" “Feed” is the current system’s old"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"name, and many of its APIs carry it. It doesn’t describe a format or a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"look: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedEditionService","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" fetches a classic PDF edition as readily as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a responsive one, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedReaderViewController","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" shows both. The same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holds for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".feedArchive"},{"type":"text","text":" sections, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/KioskFeedPublication","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedSearchService","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"feedEdition…"},{"type":"text","text":" analytics events, such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/EventChannel\/AnalyticsEvent\/feedEditionLaunch(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Where these docs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"say “feed edition”, they’re naming one of these APIs or setting the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"current system against the legacy one."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some “replica” names mean the classic PDF look."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" A few names on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"current system say “replica” for a classic PDF edition’s printed-page"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"look, not for the legacy system:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEEdition\/isReplicaEdition()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for a classic PDF edition,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose PDF pages pair into facing spreads."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEPage","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEPage\/type","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"replica_pdf_page","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is a PDF"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"page; "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEPage\/isPDF","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" covers it."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/EventChannel\/AnalyticsEvent\/feedEditionReplicaView(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" fires when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the user views a PDF page."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Everywhere else, “replica” in an API name means the legacy replica"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".replicaArchive(guid:)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/KioskReplicaPublication","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ReplicaSearchService","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ReaderConfiguration\/useLegacyReplicaReader","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"replica…"},{"type":"text","text":" analytics events, and the delegate methods that take a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replica edition."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Know which PageSuite system serves your editions, what that means for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"your app, and why some API names say “feed” or “replica”."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Edition-Platforms","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Edition Platforms